SpiceFuzz generated DC operating-point netlist
.model NMOD NMOS LEVEL=1 VTO=0.45 KP=800u LAMBDA=0.12
.model PMOD PMOS LEVEL=1 VTO=-0.45 KP=400u LAMBDA=0.12
.model DCLAMP D IS=1e-12 N=1.25 RS=1
VDD vdd 0 DC 5
VBIAS qbias 0 DC 2.5
RBIAS vdd q 500k
MNQ q qb 0 0 NMOD W=10u L=1u
MPQ q qb vdd vdd PMOD W=20u L=1u
MNQB qb q 0 0 NMOD W=10u L=1u
MPQB qb q vdd vdd PMOD W=20u L=1u
RQ q 0 1g
RQB qb 0 1g
.ic V(q)=5 V(qb)=0
.op
.print op v(vdd) v(q) v(qb) i(VDD)
.end
